    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to this beautiful beachy home in Santa Rosa Beach, right off 30A!<br>Just a 2.5-minute walk to the stunning beach and Eastern Lake—where salt water mixes with fresh for a true two-for-one coastal experience. This upscale, brand-new luxury property sleeps 10 guests comfortably in 4 bedrooms (all upstairs for privacy), with 5 bathrooms total (including 2 downstairs for convenience).<br>Key Highlights & Spaces for Everyone:<br>• Private Heated Pool – Relax year-round in your own heated oasis (heating included or add-on as needed).<br>• 6-Seater Golf Cart + 4 Beach Cruisers – Cruise to Seaside, restaurants, coffee shops, or the beach with ease—no extra rental needed! Signature of waiver for golf cart is needed at the time of check in. <br>• For Little Ones – Adorable downstairs children’s reading nook filled with books and cozy vibes.<br>• For Older Kids – Fun garage/hangout room with games for all ages.<br>• For Adults – Quiet bonus room escape with desk, large flat-screen TV, and seating for 4 (perfect for work or unwinding—kids welcome too).<br>• Chef’s Kitchen – Fully equipped with premium appliances, plus a patio grill for outdoor cooking.<br>• Luxurious Touches – Upscale decor and furnishings throughout, full laundry room, fast WiFi, and thoughtful luxury details.<br>Location Perks – Walk to dining and coffee, or take a short bike/golf cart ride to iconic Seaside for shopping, restaurants, and family fun. Eastern Lake Beach access is kid-friendly “when tides are right”.<br>Important Notes – If traveling with elderly guests who can’t do stairs, let us know—we can accommodate using the office space downstairs. Please note the entrance has three steps up to the home.<br>Make your vacation the one you deserve—book this Seagrove Beach gem today for unforgettable 30A memories!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
