        "title": "Amazing spot!!",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Katy G.",
        "date": "2025-07-22T19:42:39Z",
        "id": "687ff8292552e7203c7fe067",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Loved our stay! It is essential with kids to have a private pool too so this was perfect. Our kids loved that there was the lake to play in when they wanted to take a break from the beach. The beach access was a surprise at first and we worried about walking through waist deep water to get to beach but it turned out to be just fine and it honestly kept the crowds down on the beach. Location was perfect to beach access. The beach access is a few minutes walk from house but definitely recommend renting a golf cart for your stay bc that is easiest getting around to beach/dining/grocery/shops. The house is very nice. Do wish they had shades on windows to help with keeping place cool and sunlight coming through at 5:30 am but that was a minor detail bc we are all early risers. Loved our stay and definitely would come again.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
